426
00:35:41.556 --> 00:35:42.640
Sino ka para sabihin yan?

427
00:35:43.349 --> 00:35:45.977
Ano ba talaga ang relasyon niyo
kasama si Hee-joo?

428
00:35:46.060 --> 00:35:47.186
